  "adaptations": [
    "Original map kit landmarks uniformly miniaturized and composed around a shared road",
    "Dark native material palette retained; black plaster mean and car texture colours baked into vertices",
    "Hidden room meshes replaced by three-fenestra interiors on original glass and lit window faces",
    "Original panes and adjoining reveals pinned at both LODs; no pruning of windows; glass and display panels separated from plaster by 3/1024 map metres",
    "Enclosed plaster omitted conservatively; original display panels retained with host cyan scanlines",
    "Original neon geometry merged; no sign image overlays or video decoders",
    "Quadra body and four wheel groups reduced into one host-animated draw",
    "Three measured draws at both LODs, including car and neon"
  ],
